{"id": 16943, "title": "Do you know them?", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "do-you-know-them", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/16943_do-you-know-them.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["你认识这两个人吗？她是我的中文老师，姓王；他是我弟弟的英文老师，姓李。王老师很漂亮，她今年二十八岁，喜欢旅游和跑步。李老师很高，今年三十二岁，在大学工作。他们两个人认识五年了，有一个女儿和一个儿子。女儿一岁，儿子三岁，他们会说中文，也会说英文。王老师和李老师都是很好的人，我和弟弟都很喜欢他们。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["你認識這兩個人嗎？她是我的中文老師，姓王；他是我弟弟的英文老師，姓李。王老師很漂亮，她今年二十八歲，喜歡旅遊和跑步。李老師很高，今年三十二歲，在大學工作。他們兩個人認識五年了，有一個女兒和一個兒子。女兒一歲，兒子三歲，他們會說中文，也會說英文。王老師和李老師都是很好的人，我和弟弟都很喜歡他們。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["nǐ rèn shi zhè liǎng gè rén ma？ tā shì wǒ de Zhōng wén lǎo shī， xìng Wáng； tā shì wǒ dì di de Yīng wén lǎo shī， xìng Lǐ。 Wáng lǎo shī hěn piào liang， tā jīn nián èr shí bā suì， xǐ huan lǚ yóu hé pǎo bù。 Lǐ lǎo shī hěn gāo， jīn nián sān shí èr suì， zài dà xué gōng zuò。 tā men liǎng gè rén rèn shi wǔ nián le， yǒu yī gè nǚ ér hé yī gè ér zi。 nǚ ér yī suì， ér zi sān suì， tā men huì shuō Zhōng wén， yě huì shuō Yīng wén。 Wáng lǎo shī hé Lǐ lǎo shī dōu shì hěn hǎo de rén， wǒ hé dì di dōu hěn xǐ huan tā men。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Do you know these two people? She is my Chinese teacher, surnamed Wang; he is my brother's English teacher, surnamed Li. Teacher Wang is very beautiful. She is twenty-eight years old and likes traveling and running. Teacher Li is very tall, thirty-two years old, and works in a university. The two have known each other for five years and have a daughter and a son. The daughter is one year old and the son is three years old. They can speak Chinese and English. Teacher Wang and Teacher Li are both very good people. My brother and I like them very much."], "english_full": "Do you know these two people? She is my Chinese teacher, surnamed Wang; he is my brother's English teacher, surnamed Li. Teacher Wang is very beautiful. She is twenty-eight years old and likes traveling and running. Teacher Li is very tall, thirty-two years old, and works in a university. The two have known each other for five years and have a daughter and a son. The daughter is one year old and the son is three years old. They can speak Chinese and English. Teacher Wang and Teacher Li are both very good people. My brother and I like them very much.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rèn shi\" data-defn=\"to know / to recognize / to be familiar with / to get acquainted with sb\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">认识</span><span class=\"tr\">認識</span><rt>rèn shi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ma\" data-defn=\"(question particle for &quot;yes-no&quot; questions)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby>？<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ de\" data-defn=\"my; mine\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhōng wén\" data-defn=\"Chinese language\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">中文</span><span class=\"tr\">中文</span><rt>Zhōng wén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo shī\" data-defn=\"teacher\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xìng\" data-defn=\"to be surnamed ...\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">姓</span><span class=\"tr\">姓</span><rt>xìng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Wáng\" data-defn=\"surname Wang\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">王</span><span class=\"tr\">王</span><rt>Wáng</rt></ruby>；<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dì di\" data-defn=\"younger brother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">弟弟</span><span class=\"tr\">弟弟</span><rt>dì di</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Yīng wén\" data-defn=\"English (language)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">英文</span><span class=\"tr\">英文</span><rt>Yīng wén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo shī\" data-defn=\"teacher\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby>，<ruby cla